---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Feynman integrals & periods" active="research" description="Research archive on geometric structures and renormalization of Feynman periods.">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">首页</a><span>/</span><a href="/research/">研究</a><span>/</span>费曼周期</div>
    <header class="page-heading">
      <p class="page-kicker">RESEARCH PROGRAMME / 01</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Feynman Integrals & Periods</h1>
      <p class="page-lead" data-zh="研究费曼图积分的几何与算术结构，以及它们在微分、切割、收缩和重整化下的行为。" data-en="Geometric and arithmetic structures of Feynman graph integrals, and their behaviour under differentiation, cuts, contractions and renormalization.">研究费曼图积分的几何与算术结构，以及它们在微分、切割、收缩和重整化下的行为。</p>
    </header>
    <section class="section-block">
      <h2 data-zh="核心问题" data-en="Central questions">核心问题</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>费曼积分不仅是待计算的特殊函数或数值。它们也携带由图拓扑、参数空间和代数簇决定的几何信息。研究目标是建立从图到周期结构、再到物理可观测量的可检验联系。</p>
        <ul>
          <li>哪些图论操作保留或改变周期的几何类型？</li>
          <li>Symanzik 多项式、Picard–Fuchs 方程与单值群如何共同识别周期结构？</li>
          <li>切割、UV 收缩、森林减除和参数微分能否组织成一般的操作演算？</li>
          <li>几何分类能否对 RG 系数、阈值结构或解析函数空间给出可证伪的预测？</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section-block">
      <h2 data-zh="研究结构" data-en="Research structure">研究结构</h2>
      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="info-card"><span class="card-number">A / GRAPH</span><h3>Graph topology</h3><p>图族、子图、收缩、切割与图多项式。</p></article>
        <article class="info-card"><span class="card-number">B / GEOMETRY</span><h3>Period geometry</h3><p>参数空间、微分方程、单值性与混合周期。</p></article>
        <article class="info-card"><span class="card-number">C / OPERATIONS</span><h3>Operational calculus</h3><p>UV 森林、端点下降、物理投影与匹配。</p></article>
        <article class="info-card"><span class="card-number">D / PHYSICS</span><h3>Physical closure</h3><p>重整化、RG、Ward 恒等式与物理审计。</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section-block feature-panel">
      <p class="page-kicker">PUBLIC RESEARCH MATERIAL</p>
      <h2 data-zh="公开研究档案" data-en="Public research archive">公开研究档案</h2>
      <p data-zh="主稿、统一研究总稿、图族分类、专题文稿、证明记录、代码与计算证书集中保存在 YuPhysics 仓库。仓库中不同日期的手稿版本并不自动等同于已发表结论；请以各文件的状态说明为准。" data-en="The main manuscript, unified research volume, graph-family classification, focused papers, proof notes, code and computational certificates are collected in YuPhysics. Different dated manuscript snapshots are not automatically published results; consult each document's status notes.">主稿、统一研究总稿、图族分类、专题文稿、证明记录、代码与计算证书集中保存在 YuPhysics 仓库。仓库中不同日期的手稿版本并不自动等同于已发表结论；请以各文件的状态说明为准。</p>
      <div class="publication-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/publications/">论文与手稿索引 ↗</a><a class="button button-quiet" href="https://github.com/Ynotfound/YuPhysics/tree/main/feynman-periods/research" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub research archive ↗</a></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
